        <h2 class="guestpost-subheading">Guest Post Guidelines</h2>
        <ul class="guestpost-list">
          <li><strong class="guestpost-bold">Original Content Only</strong> - No plagiarized or AI-spun content.</li>
          <li><strong class="guestpost-bold">Word Count:</strong> Minimum 800-1200 words.</li>
          <li><strong class="guestpost-bold">Quality:</strong> Informative, well-structured, SEO-optimized.</li>
