          <li><strong class="guestpost-bold">Formatting:</strong> Use H1, H2, H3 headings, short paragraphs, and bullet
            points where needed.</li>
          <li><strong class="guestpost-bold">Niche Relevance:</strong> We accept posts related to:
            <ul class="guestpost-list">
              <li>Digital Marketing</li>
              <li>Technology</li>
              <li>Business</li>
              <li>Finance</li>
              <li>Health & Wellness</li>
              <li>Education</li>
            </ul>
            (Let us know if your topic falls outside these - we'll review it)
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="guestpost-subheading">Pricing</h2>
        <ul class="guestpost-list">
          <li><strong class="guestpost-bold">Guest Post (with 1 do-follow link):</strong> &#8377;11,000 / $150</li>
          <li><strong class="guestpost-bold">Extra Link:</strong> &#8377;1,500 / $20 each</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="guestpost-text"><strong class="guestpost-bold">Turnaround Time:</strong> 1-3 days after content
          approval and payment.</p>

        <h2 class="guestpost-subheading">To Proceed</h2>
        <p class="guestpost-text">Please share:</p>
        <ul class="guestpost-list">
          <li>Your article (or topic ideas)</li>
          <li>Your preferred anchor text and link</li>
          <li>Author bio (optional)</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="guestpost-text">If you have any questions, feel free to reach out. Looking forward to collaborating!
        </p>

        <h2 class="guestpost-subheading">Terms & Conditions</h2>

        <h3 class="guestpost-section-heading">1. Original Content Only</h3>
        <p class="guestpost-text">All submissions must be 100% original and not published elsewhere (including your own
          blog, Medium, LinkedIn, etc.). We do not accept AI-generated, plagiarized, or spun content.</p>

        <h3 class="guestpost-section-heading">2. Content Quality & Relevance</h3>
        <ul class="guestpost-list">
          <li>Minimum word count: 800-1200 words</li>
          <li>The article must be well-written, free from grammatical errors, and provide real value to our readers.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="guestpost-section-heading">3. Linking Policy</h3>
        <ul class="guestpost-list">
          <li>1 do-follow link is allowed per post (to your website or blog).</li>
          <li>Additional links (if any) must be approved in advance as per extra cost.</li>
          <li>No affiliate or spammy links are allowed.</li>
          <li>Internal links to relevant existing posts on our website may be added for SEO.</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="guestpost-section-heading">4. Images & Media</h3>
        <ul class="guestpost-list">
          <li>Include only royalty-free or original images.</li>
          <li>Image credits must be provided if necessary.</li>
          <li>We reserve the right to edit, add, or remove images to meet our design standards.</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="guestpost-section-heading">5. Editorial Rights</h3>
        <ul class="guestpost-list">
          <li>We may edit the content for grammar, tone, formatting, and SEO.</li>
          <li>We may decline any submission without providing a reason.</li>
          <li>We reserve the right to remove or update the post at any time if it no longer aligns with our content
            strategy.</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="guestpost-section-heading">6. Submission & Publication</h3>
        <ul class="guestpost-list">
          <li>Allow 1-3 business days for review.</li>
          <li>Final decision regarding publication rests with our editorial team.</li>
          <li>Once published, content cannot be removed without a valid reason.</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="guestpost-section-heading">7. Fees & Payment</h3>
        <p class="guestpost-text">A guest post fee will be paid in advance.</p>

